# 11. Execution States

```swift
enum AuraSceneExecutionState: Sendable, Equatable {
    case preparing
    case validating
    case executing(progress: Double)
    case waitingForDevice
    case cancelling
    case succeeded
    case partiallySucceeded
    case failed(AuraSceneExecutionError)
    case cancelled
}
```

State changes must be monotonic except for internal retries.

A completed execution must never return to an active state.

