# 13. Execution Policies

```swift
enum AuraSceneExecutionPolicy: String, Sendable, Codable {
    case strict
    case balanced
    case bestEffort
}
```

## 13.1 Strict

- Stop when a required action fails.
- Do not continue dependent actions.
- Report failure clearly.

Use for scenes where incorrect partial state is undesirable.

## 13.2 Balanced

- Continue independent actions.
- Stop only affected dependency branches.
- Report partial success.

This should be the default.

## 13.3 Best Effort

- Attempt all safe actions.
- Record failures.
- Complete as partially successful unless no meaningful action succeeded.

Use for broad convenience scenes such as Good Night.

---

# 14. Failure Policies

```swift
enum AuraActionFailurePolicy: String, Sendable, Codable {
    case required
    case optional
    case continueGroup
    case stopGroup
    case stopScene
}
```

Required actions influence the final scene state.

Optional actions may fail without changing a successful result when the scene’s intended experience is still achieved.

Optional must not be used to hide important failures.

