# 26. User Feedback

## 26.1 Start

On activation:

- Immediate visual pressed state.
- Light haptic.
- Scene card enters executing state.
- Progress appears only when execution is not near-instant.

## 26.2 Success

On success:

- Scene card settles into active state where meaningful.
- Success haptic.
- Brief confirmation.
- Avoid large modal interruptions.

## 26.3 Partial Success

- Warning haptic only when appropriate.
- Concise explanation.
- Offer details or diagnostics.

## 26.4 Failure

- Error feedback must be calm and actionable.
- Preserve a Retry action.
- Do not expose raw plugin errors.

