# 27. Scene Active State

Some scenes can be inferred as active from current device state.

Examples:

- Movie Night may be active when TV is on, Apple TV input is selected and Cinema lights are active.
- Good Night may be active when all configured lights are off and media devices are sleeping.

Scene active state is an interpretation, not a guarantee.

```swift
enum AuraSceneActivationState: Sendable, Equatable {
    case inactive
    case activating
    case active(confidence: Double)
    case partiallyActive(confidence: Double)
    case unknown
}
```

Confidence must not be shown as a raw number in normal UI.

