# 38. Error Model

```swift
enum AuraSceneExecutionError: Error, Sendable, Equatable {
    case sceneNotFound
    case invalidScene([AuraSceneValidationIssue])
    case targetUnavailable(AuraTargetReference)
    case capabilityUnavailable(AuraCapability)
